<!-- AUDIT-2026-08-23 (C4) — doctor recommended a prescription; the patient
     has not bought the add-on. Sent by an operator from /admin/orders/:id. -->
<h2 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#1a365d;">
  Your specialist recommends a prescription
</h2>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a5568;">
  Hi {{patientName}},
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a5568;">
  While reviewing case <strong>{{caseReference}}</strong>, your specialist judged that a
  prescription would help. A digital prescription is a separate add-on to your written
  opinion{{#if addonPrice}}, priced at <strong>{{addonCurrency}} {{addonPrice}}</strong>{{/if}}.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a5568;">
  It is entirely your choice. Your written opinion is unaffected and will be delivered on
  time either way. If you would like the prescription, reply to this email or message us on
  WhatsApp and our team will arrange it — your specialist will then issue it, signed, as a PDF.
</p>

{{#if dashboardUrl}}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:24px 0 0 0;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="background-color:#38b2ac;border-radius:8px;">
      <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 32px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">
        Open Your Case
      </a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
{{/if}}
